From e8374ad38c2c442683aea4ee224254b87c16ddc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 17:23:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: cix: harden Sky1 audio paths

Port srcshelton's 73050 sound/soc/cix hardening patch onto our v7.2 series after 0223.

The clock, jack, TDM, IRQ, PM and softdep hunks apply directly or with offsets. The ACPI HDMI-codec section needed manual reconciliation because our series already resolves the hdmi-codec child below the DP firmware node and already assigns per-DP codec prefixes; preserve that local shape while adding managed card-to-I2S and card-to-codec device links plus bound-supplier deferral.
